WooliesX is sort of
the experimental arm

00:41:19.730 --> 00:41:21.200
of Woolworth's in Australia.

00:41:21.200 --> 00:41:23.830
They do a lot with APIs
in digital technology.

00:41:23.830 --> 00:41:28.340
As does Kaiser Permanente,
